{"record":"event","seq":0,"at":1794221062008,"author":"sample","why":"A case file. A watch went from Rosalind Vane's study one evening, and there are three people it could have been, or someone nobody has thought of. Each account is a node saying who gave it, with how far it's believed, and when each suspect could have reached the house is worked out from those. The Worlds tab gives how likely each suspect is, and what's most worth finding out next. Pin what you learn.","ops":[{"op":"spawn","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-77399dea4094"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-77399dea4094","cell":"name","value":"The case"},{"op":"add","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-77399dea4094","component":"notes"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-77399dea4094","cell":"body","value":"Saturday evening at Rosalind Vane's house. Her late husband's gold watch was in a locked case in the study. Clara saw it there at 9:00. Rosalind found the case open and the watch gone at 10:15. Times here are minutes past nine, so 9:40 is 40."},{"op":"spawn","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773a27541370"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773a27541370","cell":"name","value":"Who took it?"},{"op":"add","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773a27541370","component":"decision"},{"op":"add","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773a27541370","component":"uncertain"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773a27541370","cell":"arrives","formula":"pick(o in in.alternative: o.arrives)"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773a27541370","cell":"from_garden","formula":"pick(o in in.alternative: o.from_garden)"},{"op":"spawn","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773b4f9883af"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773b4f9883af","cell":"name","value":"Tom"},{"op":"add","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773b4f9883af","component":"notes"},{"op":"set","id":"01a1bfe8-b76e-73e1-a55c-773b4f9883af","cell":"body","value":"Rosalind's nephew. He owes money, and he knew where the key to the case was kept."},{"op":"link","fr